    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Well, this was a decision that the Majority Leader made, and it's a decision that I'm very pleased with, and I look forward to working with Mitch McConnell and the rest of the Republican leadership team to bring the Utah model to Washington. to help unify the party, and unite the party behind an affirmative reform agenda, one that will help promote economic growth throughout the country, helping poor families get out of poverty and helping to expand the middle class.",
