        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Focusing on opposition is insufficient for long-term political success.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker possesses relevant expertise in legislative strategy and coalition-building.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The Republican Party’s public image benefits from promoting constructive policy proposals.",
