    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/4/64503.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Yes, yes. And so once a week, the majority leader holds meetings in his office. Those will be attended by, of course, the majority leader himself and by the whip. And a few others and the four of us who have been named as counsel to the majority leader will attend that meeting. And so that'll give us an opportunity to talk about our policy agenda and to find ways to unite senators. Ideally, senators of both political parties behind an agenda that will help bring about better tomorrow. We'll help improve the lives of Utahns and people across America.",
