    "turn_text": "I'm sure that Mitch McConnell and those who were advising him through this process looked around and wanted certain individuals. Do you suspect that perhaps because of a reputation of being a bit of a maverick, things that you have done with Ted Cruz and so on, that Mitch McConnell, first of all, wanted the input from that perspective, but also kind of wanted to bring into the fold a little bit?",
